            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A component assembly (200;300;400;500;600;704) includes a first component (102;705) that has a first hole (206;306;406;506;606;730). The first hole (206;306;406;506;606;730) has a non-circular cross section. A first portion (217;716) of the first hole (206;...;730) has a first radius of curvature (R1) and a second component (104;712). A pin (208;308;408;508;608;708) extends from the second component (104;712) and through the first hole (206;...;730). The pin (208;...;708) has a non-circular cross section. A second portion (216;316;516;616) of the pin (208;...;708) has a second radius of curvature (R2). The first radius of curvature (R1) and the second radius of curvature (R2) are substantially the same.</p>
            </abstract>
